4. SCIENTIFIC & USER EXPERIENCE EVALUATION
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- Real-time Interval Previews:
  Instead of generic static labels (+1 ngày, +3 ngày), students immediately see exact
  adaptive intervals computed by FSRS (e.g., 10 phút, 6 ngày, 1.5 tháng) tailored
  to the specific word's difficulty and their personal memory strength.

- Active Memory Diagnostics:
  Learners can observe their real-time retrievability R% decay on the card header
  (e.g., "🧠 Nhớ: 94% • Chu kỳ: 7 ngày"), providing transparent metacognitive awareness.

- Smart Study Sorting:
  The "🔥 Ưu tiên SRS" button reorganizes flashcard decks on the fly to prioritize words
  slipping from memory (lowest R%) before new words are introduced, maximizing learning
  efficiency and preventing the forgetting curve from taking hold.

- 7-Day Review Forecast:
  The visual bar chart in the progress modal delivers actionable workload planning,
  enabling learners to anticipate review spikes and maintain daily learning streaks.
